{"title": "Arsonist's Oil", "pageid": 11855, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arsonist's_Oil", "categories": ["Coatings", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png/300px-COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f5/COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Arsonist's Oil image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png/300px-COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/COAT_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Arsonist's Oil</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">Coating</a>). It can be applied to a weapon to give it special properties for ten turns.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>'It was then that <a href=\"/wiki/Lupperdiddle_Swires\" title=\"Lupperdiddle Swires\">Swires</a> tossed the oil.  It splattered the <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">cambion</a>, and all at once its skin of brilliant carmine dulled to dark, a red like cheap wine, and the fiend vented this sound of anguish I almost pitied, for its very affinity to fire was now undone.'\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Coating_Icon.png/25px-Coating_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Coating_Icon.png/38px-Coating_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/7d/Coating_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Coatings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Coating_Icon.png/25px-Coating_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Coating_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">Coatings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 25 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  25  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2d54930f79d9c24bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-52c92d40564d6670END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a8c1e52c0708b170END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Soultion_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Soultion_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Soultion_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">bd118cc0-eb90-412d-8229-6749f42df5c6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bd118cc0-eb90-412d-8229-6749f42df5c6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bd118cc0-eb90-412d-8229-6749f42df5c6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Oil_RemoveResistanceFire+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Coat your active weapon in Arsonist's Oil.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Coated_in_Arsonist.27s_Oil\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Coated_in_Arsonist's_Oil\"> Condition: Coated in Arsonist's Oil </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Arsonist%27s_Oil_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Arsonist's Oil (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Coated in Arsonist's Oil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Arsonist%27s_Oil_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Arsonist's Oil (Condition)\">Coated in Arsonist's Oil</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Coated in an oil that strips targets that are <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage of their Resistance.</li>\n<li>Targets that are <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to Fire damage are unaffected.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> <h2><span id=\"Condition:_Arsonist.27s_Oil\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arsonist's_Oil\"> Condition: Arsonist's Oil </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil_(Condition)\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arsonist's Oil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil_(Condition)\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil (Condition)\">Arsonist's Oil</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has been stripped of its <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Fire Resistance</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears\" title=\"Sublimate of Frosted Ears\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Frosted_Ears\" title=\"Sublimate of Frosted Ears\">Sublimate of Frosted Ears</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frosted_Ear\" title=\"Frosted Ear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png/20px-Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png/30px-Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png/40px-Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png/20px-Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Frosted_Ear_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frosted_Ear\" title=\"Frosted Ear\">Frosted Ear</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Fire vulnerability against a target can still be achieved by first making it fire resistant, then applying Arsonist's Oil and then removing its fire resistance. This can be done by first throwing a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Fire Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/ELX_Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Fire_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Fire Resistance\">Elixir of Fire Resistance</a>, and then some other elixir at it (thus overwriting the prior elixir's effects) or by applying Arsonist's oil on a target which has 1 turn of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> left and no native fire resistance.</li>\n<li>One of several references to the gnome adventurer Lupperdiddle Swires. Others appear in the descriptions of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\">Potion of Glorious Vaulting</a>, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swiresy_Shoes\" title=\"Swiresy Shoes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swiresy_Shoes\" title=\"Swiresy Shoes\">Swiresy Shoes</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swires%27_Sledboard\" title=\"Swires' Sledboard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Swires_sledboard_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swires%27_Sledboard\" title=\"Swires' Sledboard\">Swires' Sledboard</a>. \"Swires\" is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">reference</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References#Discworld\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">Discworld</a> books.</li>\n<li>This coating can be used by wild shapes but it does nothing on attack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Arsonist%27s_oil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arsonist's oil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Arsonist%27s_oil\">Arsonist's oil</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202702\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4885/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67034/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18262/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.041/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1594874/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   98.601      1 -total\n 97.97%   96.602      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n 30.07%   29.653     65 Template:Trim\n 27.77%   27.382     10 Template:Icon_text\n 16.97%   16.732      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 15.32%   15.103      3 Template:SmItemIcon\n 14.49%   14.290      2 Template:Condition\n 14.23%   14.032      3 Template:Item_icon\n 11.42%   11.264      3 Template:Uid\n  9.87%    9.731     22 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11855-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202702 